<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Acid Ball</h1>
<p>Sphere: Acid Sphere
Spell Tier: 3
Class: Sorcerer (guild level 145)
Mana: 28
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast acid ball &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast acid ball</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The caster points three fingers at the target and hisses 'Oses causter', 
and a compact ball of acid is hurled at them. It is the third of the acid 
spells, stronger than spray of acid: the better your magic and your acid 
sphere, the more it burns. It does best against clothes and less well the 
heavier the armour, and a shield can block it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It can be cast while fighting, 
and no free hands are needed. It is also found on wands, staffs and 
scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
